                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I'm a fan of physics sandbox games and this one has a very satisfying and well designed building mechanic. It's a polished, comfortable experience with an art style that works well in VR. The ability to collaborate in multiplayer and a puzzle game mode adds a lot of replay value for an Early Access game. It was actually relaxing and I sat on the floor for a portion of it, just playing with the blocks like a VR Lego Technic set. I plan on spending more time with this one. \n",
